  "content": "<p>在 Minecraft 中擴展你的裝飾可能性，透過 <strong>Copper Deco</strong>。此模組讓你不僅能將新的銅磚放置在地板上，也能安裝在牆壁和天花板上。使用銅磚裝飾任何表面，打造獨特的室內設計並凸顯你家的風格。所有瓷磚（除了簡單的銅塊磚）皆可透過切石機製作。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpostimg.cc%252f8FYDHLsf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/rmVmqJkj/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></a></p><p>你可以從瓷磚創造出擁有不同面的方塊：</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpostimg.cc%252fgxZ6RvDp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/YCXN5RLv/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpostimg.cc%252f0z0PLj5W\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Vk3v00x8/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1362062.svg\" alt=\"versions\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/blob/main/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"neoforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"fabric\"> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"patreon-singular\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fludwici\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_64h.png\" alt=\"kofi-singular\"></a></p><p>查看我的其他模組：</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G1XpmL4.png\" alt=\"carpet-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-loot-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n1X16BM.png\" alt=\"mob-loot-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-block-sounds-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epM9STT.png\" alt=\"better-block-sounds-fork\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slime-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/7LPXcWkr/so-logo-mini.png\" alt=\"slime-overhaul\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polyglot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3RCh0RZ/polyglot-mini.jpg\" alt=\"polyglot\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/hytale/mods/weapon-mastery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/C1fM4HHC/WM125.jpg\" alt=\"weapon-mastery\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NMB0gG5S/icon.png\" alt=\"bigwater\"></a></p>",
